OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue fresh appeal to
OL,4,Alocate on-the-run killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a renewed appeal for
OL,7,Finformation to locate convicted
OL,8,Fmurderer Gary Anderson, who remains
OL,9,Funlawfully at large after failing to
OL,10,Freturn to prison earlier this week.
OL,12,FThe 29-year-old, who is one of two
OL,13,Fbrothers jailed for life for the murder
OL,14,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry in 2018,
OL,15,Ffailed to return to Maghaberry prison
OL,16,Fon Monday.
OL,18,FA court granted Anderson compassionate
OL,19,Ftemporary release (CTR) to attend his
OL,20,Ffather's funeral in Derry, despite
OL,21,Fopposition from prison authorities.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
