OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue fresh appeal to
OL,4,Alocate on-the-run killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a renewed appeal on Friday, the
OL,7,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,8,F(PSNI) said Anderson was last seen on
OL,9,FMonday morning in the Eastway area of
OL,10,FCreggan in Derry at approximately 11:00
OL,11,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
